  "description": "At home on dirt, gravel, and pavement, the Hatch 2 keeps the adventure going when it’s time to explore the path less travelled. To give you the ideal balance of stability and easy handling, the Hatch features Progressive Wheel Sizing, using the wheel size that best matches the rider size. A 100mm travel fork and grippy 2.25-inch wide knobby tires help you easily roll over bumps and potholes with confidence. With 21 gear combinations at your fingertips, you’ll always find a comfortable pedaling pace, and Radius hydraulic disc brakes provide reliable stopping power. And if you’re looking for an all-arounder, this bike has mounts for a fender and rack to haul your gear. Own your adventure without breaking the bank on the Hatch.",
